const POOL: Record<string, CompactTuple> = {"rev-ahac-001":["rev-ahac-001","Bryan M.",5,"Waipahu","Waipahu Warehouse Pickup","Google Verified","Brian",["quiet","lg","ge","energy","warehouse"],"I found this company on Google. They are located in the Waipahu industrial area across from the old City Mill. The LG AC unit my mother needed was in stock - so that was a HUGE plus. However, she left 3 messages for them during the day on a Friday (May 1st). Brian called her Saturday morning and my mother went to their warehouse that morning and picked up an upgraded LG AC unit (more energy efficient & way more quiet) that was installed yesterday (May 3rd).\n\nYes, we wish they returned her call sooner, but they were likely very busy and/or short staffed. Also, their website has been down since May 1st. Not sure why that is, but tried to visit their website again this morning (May 4th) and it's still down. Hope they get that resolved soon.\n\nOverall, we'd recommend Affordable Home AC in Waipahu, and in particular Brian. Brian was cordial; he said and did all the right things. Thank you again, Brian!","Waipahu Warehouse Customer"],"rev-ahac-002":["rev-ahac-002","Tommylynn B.",5,"Honolulu","Window AC Installation","Yelp Verified","Brian",[],"I replaced two window ac units, called on Wednesday and Brian came out the next day. Professional, timely and installation was flawless! Mahalo Brian!","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-003":["rev-ahac-003","Ron T.",5,"Ewa Beach","Window AC Installation","Yelp Verified","Chris",["ge","wifi"],"Very efficient and worked on a holiday (Veterans Day) to replace my large window AC. My AC also has WiFi so I can control it outside my home. Chris was very professional and was teaching his coworkers the tips and tricks on a successful installation.\n\nChris installed a total of 2 ACs in my place. They are busy but they will stick to their schedule! Thank you guys for installing my ACs!!!\n\nThey also do maintenance on the units!","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-004":["rev-ahac-004","Adrienne L.",5,"Kailua","Window AC Cleaning & Service","Yelp Verified","Chris",["clean","lanai","honest"],"We had gotten our window unit initially installed by Affordable Home AC a year ago. We noticed our unit started leaking onto the Lanai, and called them up to take a look at the issue. They were able to give us a quote on the phone, and schedule within 2 days.\n\nChris came onsite, remembered us, and was able to remove, assess the issue, and correct the unit within an hour and a half. We also asked him what best practices were to maintain our unit to maximize it's lifecycle. He was honest, and gave us things we should do weekly ourselves (checking the filter to clean) and scheduling maintenance just short of yearly. As people who aren't familiar with AC systems, he's extremely knowledgable, has great bedside manners, and is a really honest guy who isn't money grabbing at every opportunity.\n\nWe plan to reach out for future services and any other AC needs we will have in the future!","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-005":["rev-ahac-005","Samuel L.",5,"Pearl City","Window AC Cleaning & Service","Yelp Verified","Brian",["quiet","inverter","lg","clean","cleaning"],"My A/C was running sluggish and figured it needed to be cleaned (been 2 years since installed).\nContacted Affordable Home AC and was referred to Chris at Window A/C Cleaning Services (808) 488-1111. They made an appointment with me, were on time, efficient and friendly.\nNow my A/C runs like it's new again! Great!\nIn the future, I'm not going to wait until my A/C unit starts to run sluggish again.\nAffordable Home A/C & Window\nA/C Cleaning Services! Mahalo!\n\nBryan M.\n\nAug 12, 2025\n\nThank you for your kind words. We appreciate you.\n\nOct 20, 2024Previous review\nAloha! It's been just over a year since I've had Brian and his crew install my LG Dual Inverter 12,000BTU A/C and it's been great, running it day and night! So grateful for going with Affordable Home AC! NO REGRETS!\n\nNov 6, 2023Previous review\nAloha, it's been 2 months since I've had my LG Dual Inverter A/C in stalled and have not turned the unit off. It's not only quiet but so efficient that it's been on 72 degrees 24/7 (on energy saving mode) and haven't made any difference on my electric bill!\nMahalo Brian & crew at Affordable Home A/C! Love it!\n\nSep 12, 2023Previous review\nGreat job! Brian and his crew are professional, friendly, clean & neat. Great job! Great LG A/C!\nVery happy and satisfied that it was them who did the work.\nNo complaints.","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-006":["rev-ahac-006","Mermaid S.",5,"Mililani","Window AC Installation","Yelp Verified","Brian",["quiet","lg","ge","clean","apartment"],"The AC unit stopped working in my apartment so my landlord helped make arrangements to connect with Brian and Chris. They were very professional and had a new AC installed in less than an hour. Not only is it energy efficient, I can also control it from my phone and they took the time to go over all this with me after the install. I followed all their advice and sure enough, I came home to a perfect temperature and slept so well for the first time in a while. The LG unit they installed is also very quiet and blows crisp, clean air. Mahalo again for such great service, Brian and Chris. Highly recommend for your AC needs, especially since summer is coming.","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-007":["rev-ahac-007","B H.",5,"Aiea","Window AC Installation","Yelp Verified","Brian",["estimate"],"Excellent business to work with. Quick response to providing an estimate and recommendations. Amazingly, they arrived a little earlier than scheduled and completed the job beautifully. Highly recommend. Thank you Brian, Chris and the crew. Very impressive.\n\nJoyce T.\nElite 26","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-008":["rev-ahac-008","Tim B.",5,"Waipahu","LG Dual Inverter","Yelp Verified","Brian",["quiet","lg","ge","energy"],"I am giving Affordable Home Air Conditioning in Waipahu my highest recommendation to other Yelp users in the Honolulu area. Brian Borges and his team were quick, thorough and cost effective. I work from home and AC is essential for me. Brian's team were able to respond quickly and installed a new LG window air conditioning unit. The new unit is fantastic; quiet, powerful and energy efficient. My home office is much cooler and quieter now. Mahalo to Brian and his team for their excellent service. If you need help with your AC, give Brian a call at (808) 488-1111 today. You'll be glad you did!","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-009":["rev-ahac-009","Audrie O.",5,"Kaneohe","Window AC Cleaning & Service","Yelp Verified","Chris",["clean","cleaning"],"Chris was great. He got back with me very quickly with the quote for cleaning. And then he was right on time coming for the job. He did a great job cleaning out our dirty A/C window unit and made great recommendations about what we can do in the future to replace another older window unit. We were very satisfied with the job they did and will definitely be using their services in the near future! I would definitely recommend using them!","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-011":["rev-ahac-011","Miss L.",5,"Honolulu","Window AC Installation","Yelp Verified","Brian",["rebate"],"Affordable Home AC did an excellent job in installing a new window unit air conditioner and removing and replacing two other window units. After the job was completed they gave me the receipt and rebate form. I am very happy with the work they did! Their workmanship was excellent and I would highly recommend them! They do beautiful work. Thank you Brian, Chris and Omar!","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-012":["rev-ahac-012","Carrie N.",5,"Ewa Beach","Waipahu Warehouse Pickup","Yelp Verified","Waipahu Dispatch Team",["rebate","prompt"],"Friendly and prompt customer service! Took the time to explain how to install unit and had a rebate application printed out for me on pick up (with necessary info filled out). Very prifessional, thorough and organized operation.\n\nStarla T.","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-013":["rev-ahac-013","Jojo G.",5,"Kailua","Window AC Installation","Yelp Verified","Waipahu Dispatch Team",[],"Highly recommend to anyone needing AC services. Very accommodating, great customer service and does excellent work!!\n\nAron N.","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-014":["rev-ahac-014","Mary W.",5,"Pearl City","Window AC Cleaning & Service","Yelp Verified","Brian",["clean"],"Made an appt to replace my AC and made sure to accommodate my need to replace the old ac asap. His team called and to confirm the address and arrived early. The install was quick and efficient and clean, both tech was very nice, answered all my concern and question. What a great Company to work with, am already making plan to replace the 2 other old ac in my home.\nI will sure recommend them to friend and family\nMuch Mahalo\nBrian and Team\nAffordable Home AC","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-016":["rev-ahac-016","Mark D.",5,"Aiea","Window AC Cleaning & Service","Yelp Verified","Brian",["quiet","lg","clean","estimate"],"Thrilled with the work completed by Affordable Home AC. They did a great job with a tricky replacement project for 3 in-wall AC units. From initial contact to final install was about 1.5 weeks. This included talking to Brian via the phone to see if the project was something they would do, Brian coming out to do an inspection/estimate, and finally the installation day. Couldn't ask for better! The three new LG units work well, are quiet, and were really cleanly installed. Mahalo Brian and team. Strongly recommended!","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-017":["rev-ahac-017","Mark E.",5,"Kapolei","Window AC Cleaning & Service","Yelp Verified","Brian",["ge","clean","apartment"],"I had Affordable Home AC install a new through-the-wall air conditioner in my apartment. They did a great job. I quickly made arrangements with Brian, and the installers Chris and Makua (sorry if I spelled the name wrong) arrived at the appointed time and very efficiently removed and hauled away the old A.C., installed the new one, showed me how to use it, and cleaned up. The new A.C. works really well.\nExcellent service.","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-023":["rev-ahac-023","Jay M.",5,"Pearl City","LG Dual Inverter","Yelp Verified","Brian",["quiet","lg","ge","living room","energy"],"This company is definitely trustworthy and great at their jobs!\nI called and left a message on their machine and they called me back the following day because they do their installations throughout the day and return late in the afternoon.\nI scheduled an in home estimate with Brian and was trying to replace my living room Friedrich unit and was recommended the LG as a quieter and more energy efficient option. They returned a week later with the installation team and after an hour, they were finished. Installation looked great, everything was sealed up front and back and framed with new trim wood. The unit is sooooo much quieter than the last one and I am a happy customer with nothing but great things to say.\nThank you to Brian and Chris for your hard work and kind words","Oahu Verified Customer"],"rev-ahac-045":["rev-ahac-045","Isa R.",5,"Kaneohe","Waipahu Warehouse Pickup","Yelp Verified","Waipahu Dispatch Team",["living room"],"They did a great job at replacing a 15+ year old window a/c in the living room. Living in Ewa, a working a/c is a necessity not a luxury. It was just about impossible finding an 18,000 unit BTU window air conditioner that would ship to Hawaii, and Lowe's and Home Depot didn't have any in stock. It took about three weeks as the soonest appointment for someone to come to the house to do measurements and a free quote. Once that was done, I got an appointment for the next week to do the install. I was really pleased with all of the staff from the estimator to the installers. It was installed in just under an hour, and they hauled away the old unit. I appreciated the quick tutorial on all of the features. I would definitely use them again for any a/c needs.","Oahu Verified Customer"]};

function hydrate(id: string): Review {
    const t = POOL[id];
    return {
        id: t[0],
        author: t[1],
        rating: t[2],
        neighborhood: t[3],
        service_tag: t[4],
        platform: t[5],
        technicians: t[6] && t[6] !== 'Waipahu Dispatch Team' ? [t[6]] : [],
        primary_technician: t[6],
        keywords: t[7],
        text: t[8],
        sanitized_text: t[8],
        verified: true,
        badge: t[9],
    };
}

